<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png" /><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
<meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>The Marketing Plan — Vault Human</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
<meta name="description" content="How Vault Human grows, step by step, from our first members to our first full year." />
<meta property="og:title" content="The Marketing Plan — Vault Human" /><meta property="og:description" content="How the gates open: step by step to March and through 2027." /><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.vaulthuman.com/og-keyholders.jpg" /><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" /><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,400;1,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style is:inline>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--bg:#F7F4EE;--bg2:#EFEBE2;--card:#fff;--line:#E2DCD0;--ink:#1E2620;--soft:#46504A;--mute:#7A847C;--sage:#5F7A5B;--in:#6E8F5E;--out:#C0794F;--gold:#A8823A}
html,body{overflow-x:hidden}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
section{padding:72px 0} .alt{background:var(--bg2)}
.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:.95}
h1{font-size:clamp(54px,9vw,104px)} h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--sage)}
h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5.5vw,60px);margin-bottom:14px} h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--sage)}
h3{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:6px}
p{color:var(--soft);font-size:16px} .lede{font-family:Fraunces,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);max-width:760px}
.top{padding-top:28px} .brand{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:18px;letter-spacing:5px} .brand span{color:var(--sage)}
.hero{padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:56px} .rule{width:56px;height:3px;background:var(--sage);margin:22px 0}
.big{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:40px}
.bn{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 18px;border-top:4px solid var(--sage)}
.bn .v{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:52px;line-height:1} .bn .l{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4}
.bn.out{border-top-color:var(--out)} .bn.out .v{color:var(--out)} .bn.in .v{color:var(--in)} .bn.gold{border-top-color:var(--gold)} .bn.gold .v{color:var(--gold)}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px}
.chart{width:100%;height:auto;display:block} .chart .gl{stroke:#ECE7DD} .chart .ax{font:12px Inter;fill:#7A847C} .chart .lb{font:600 14px Inter} .chart .lb2{font:italic 14px Fraunces;fill:#5F7A5B}
.key{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--soft);margin:4px 0 10px} .key i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:-1px}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.tbl{overflow-x:auto;margin-top:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--card)}
table{border-collapse:collapse;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:13px;width:max-content;min-width:100%}
td.ny,th.ny{border-left:3px solid var(--sage)} th.m.ny{color:var(--sage);font-weight:700} .yb{display:block;font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:2px}
th,td{padding:9px 8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #EFEAE0;white-space:nowrap}
th:first-child{text-align:left;position:sticky;left:0;background:#fff;font-weight:600;color:var(--soft);padding-left:16px}
th.m{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);font-weight:500}
tr.in td{color:var(--in);font-weight:600} tr.out td{color:var(--out)} tr.net td{font-weight:600} tr.cum td{font-weight:700;background:#F3F6EF} tr.cum th{background:#F3F6EF} tr.mem td{color:var(--ink)}
.small{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:10px}
.haul{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:26px}
.hc{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px}
.hc .v{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:44px;line-height:1;color:var(--sage)} .hc p{font-size:14px;margin-top:6px}
.steps{margin-top:26px;display:grid;gap:12px}
.step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px}
.sn{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--sage);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:24px;color:var(--sage)}
.sd{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px}
.sw{font-size:17px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.45} .sw b{color:var(--sage)} .then{font-weight:600;color:var(--gold)}
.flow{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:22px 0}
.fl{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:22px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--sage)} .fa{color:var(--mute)}
.ladder{margin-top:8px} .rung{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)} .rung b{font-weight:600} .rung span{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:22px;color:var(--gold);white-space:nowrap}
.br{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr 70px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:8px 0} .bt{font-size:14px} .bb{height:10px;background:#EFEAE0;border-radius:6px} .bb i{display:block;height:10px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--out)} .bv{text-align:right;font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:22px}
.three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:22px}
.notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:22px}
.note{background:#FBF7EC;border:1px solid #EADFC4;border-left:4px solid var(--gold);border-radius:12px;padding:18px}
.nk{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px} .note p{font-family:Fraunces,serif;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink)} .ns{font-size:12px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:8px}
.weeks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:22px}
.wk{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px} .wk .d{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);font-weight:600} .wk h3{margin:4px 0 6px} .wk p{font-size:14px}
footer{padding:56px 0 70px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)} .addr{font-size:14px;color:var(--soft);line-height:1.7} .fine{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:18px;max-width:820px}
@media(max-width:820px){.big,.haul,.three,.notes,.weeks{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} .two{grid-template-columns:1fr} section{padding:56px 0}}
@media(max-width:520px){.big .v{font-size:40px} .haul,.three,.notes,.weeks{grid-template-columns:1fr} .br{grid-template-columns:1fr 70px} .bb{grid-column:1/-1;order:3} .sw{font-size:16px}}
@media print{section{padding:36px 0;break-inside:avoid} .tbl{overflow:visible} table{min-width:0;font-size:10px} th,td{padding:6px 4px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap top"><div class="brand">VAULT <span>HUMAN</span></div></div>

<header class="wrap hero">
<div class="eyebrow">For our Keyholders · The marketing plan</div>
<h1>How the gates<br><em>open.</em></h1>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lede">We grow the way trust grows: one person at a time, then the people they love. Advertising lights the match early. Members carry it. From spring on, spending follows what members bring in.</p>
<div class="big">
<div class="bn out"><div class="v">$183K</div><div class="l">invested in marketing, Nov 2026 – Dec 2027</div></div>
<div class="bn in"><div class="v">$578K</div><div class="l">coming in over the same 14 months</div></div>
<div class="bn gold"><div class="v">$3.2</div><div class="l">back for every $1 of marketing</div></div>
<div class="bn"><div class="v">544</div><div class="l">members by December 2027</div></div>
</div>
</header>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow">Money in, money out</div>
