<section><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow">The long haul</div>
<h2>A member is worth <em>far more than they cost.</em></h2>
<div class="haul">
<div class="hc"><div class="v">~$530</div><p>to bring in one new member through advertising</p></div>
<div class="hc"><div class="v">~$2,400</div><p>what a member brings in over their time with us (about two years on average)</p></div>
<div class="hc"><div class="v">~$1M</div><p>a year: the pace we carry into 2028 from the members we've gathered</p></div>
</div>
<div class="notes" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr">
<aside class='note'><div class='nk'>Worth knowing</div><p>In its first 30 days, a new customer should bring in more than it cost to find them. Our year plan is built for exactly that.</p><div class='ns'>Alex Hormozi, <i>$100M Money Models</i> (2025)</div></aside>
<aside class='note'><div class='nk'>Worth knowing</div><p>Among adults 50–64, 85% use YouTube and 71% use Facebook. That is where we meet them.</p><div class='ns'>Pew Research Center (2026)</div></aside>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow">Step by step</div>
<h2>When one gate opens, <em>the next one follows.</em></h2>
<p>We move forward when something is proven, not when a date arrives. That keeps every dollar tied to what is already working.</p>
<div class="steps"><div class='step'><div class='sn'>1</div><div><div class='sd'>Oct 31</div><div class='sw'><b>When</b> the free week runs flawlessly for our first member, <span class='then'>then</span> personal invitations go out to the people who know us.</div></div></div><div class='step'><div class='sn'>2</div><div><div class='sd'>November</div><div class='sw'><b>When</b> our first members join, <span class='then'>then</span> the Thursday live session and every member’s two gift weeks open the door to their friends.</div></div></div><div class='step'><div class='sn'>3</div><div><div class='sd'>Late November</div><div class='sw'><b>When</b> a small ad test brings in a new person for $200 or less, <span class='then'>then</span> we advertise at full stride.</div></div></div><div class='step'><div class='sn'>4</div><div><div class='sd'>Dec – Jan</div><div class='sw'><b>When</b> each new member pays back most of their cost in the first month, <span class='then'>then</span> spending holds, and the free five-day January Reset (Jan 4–8) brings the year’s first wave.</div></div></div><div class='step'><div class='sn'>5</div><div><div class='sd'>Feb</div><div class='sw'><b>When</b> members stay and bring friends, <span class='then'>then</span> circles open, and February becomes “bring someone you love” month.</div></div></div><div class='step'><div class='sn'>6</div><div><div class='sd'>Mar 2 – 7</div><div class='sw'><b>When</b> we reach the milestone week, <span class='then'>then</span> nearly 100 members are telling the story in their own words.</div></div></div><div class='step'><div class='sn'>7</div><div><div class='sd'>Apr – Dec</div><div class='sw'><b>When</b> spending follows what members bring in, <span class='then'>then</span> partners, podcasts and a second challenge in September carry us to more than 500 members.</div></div></div></div>
</div></section>

